FluxPlayer FFmpeg 4.4.6 FLV compatibility patch

Legacy HEVC (codec-id 12), raw Opus (codec-id 13), and Enhanced FLV v1
HEVC/AV1/VP9 receive support. Original legacy patch was provided by the user.
Enhanced FLV framing follows the Veovera specification and FFmpeg n6.1.
Upstream files retain their LGPL-2.1-or-later license.

